WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Bring recorded inventory, relationships and observations into a view people can explore.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Spot missing details and follow the evidence behind summaries and findings.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Use consistent views, reports and exports to discuss the same evidence.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Choose a feature, learn how it works and practise using the guide.
